     "text": "It specifies the functional requirements for a digital radio standard for the European railways and is part of the Technical Specification for Interoperability. It encompasses ground-train voice and data communications, together with the ground- based mobile communications needs of trackside workers, station and depot staff and railway administrative and managerial personnel. 1.3.3 The statements made in the specification are assigned to one of three categories:",
