   "guide": "The speaker states the content in their own words.",
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "The EIRENE network will support the following call related services: display of identity of called/calling user; restriction of display of called/calling user; priority and pre-emption; closed user group; call forwarding; call hold; call waiting; charging information; call barring. Display of identity",
